    "Fixed player-command model with opponent AI, not actual human playtests. Four independent seeds per set; correlated weapon/policy conditions are not independent human games.",
    "Live trials stop at death or opponent defeat; end blood/damage are subject to exposure differences. Common-exposure rows use applied injuries only, not an invented HP score.",
    "Timing study uses two distances and one diagonal attack; no widened reliable input interval was demonstrated.",
    "Predictor uses constant instantaneous rigid-body rotation/translation, approximate body radii and a capped angular extrapolation. It is not future collision ground truth.",
    "Slow tip (<2.5m/s) exits prediction; lock clears after >25ms without contact if no path distance is available. Scope and actual contact alone do not guarantee protection.",
    "maxHand measures requested correction, not always applied displacement (reach constraint can reject it). Physical muscle strength and servo caps unchanged.",
    "Only two optional no-op hooks in src/fighter.js; research guard is installed by test runner/browser route only. Default/public game and upstream unchanged.",
    "Fit-only and combined path-fit are archived exploratory candidates. Path retains the strongest survival lead but limb/arm trade-offs and human usability remain unresolved."
